### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### List trips
GET http://localhost:3000/api/trips

### Create trip
POST http://localhost:3000/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weekend hike",
  "description": "A beginner-friendly hiking trip",
  "region": "Lake District",
  "startDate": "2027-05-10T09:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2027-05-11T18:00:00.000Z",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "maxParticipants": 8
}


### Get trip by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/trips/1


### Update trip
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/trips/1
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "maxParticipants": 12
}


### Delete trip
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/trips/1
